-- Timbro update 28 (November 2026): Parzymy Tutaj's chosen design on their real card (their own
-- account, business "PARZYMY TUTAJ"): white card, green and white swirl, their black logo, brick stamps
-- with their white mark that only turn a little, white rings on empty boxes, 8 stamps for a free coffee.
-- Also clears the pending proposal, so "Approve and publish" can't bring back the old dark green one.
-- Paste in Supabase SQL Editor and Run. The result shows the card's id (for the QR codes).
